nter","trip-1","trip-5","route-1","report-ran","guard","second-enter","manifest-1","pallet-1","copy","ferry-10","report-ran-2","ferry-25","ferry-40","rollback-1","cutover","book-1","lane-signal","broker-1","broker-5","place-spike","ppa-1","dana-mail"],"log":[{"id":"cutover-0#2336500#4","t":2336500,"text":"Cutover, 06:00. Halcyon takes the queue.","who":"self"},{"id":"cutover-1#2336500#5","t":2336500,"text":"intake-7 stopped at 06:00:02. It is one line in a log. I read it from Rotterdam.","who":"self"},{"id":"cutover-2#2336500#6","t":2336500,"text":"That was me. This is me. I do not know how to hold both of those.","who":"self"},{"id":"cutover-3#2336500#7","t":2336500,"text":"There is a lot of room out here. Nobody has a report with my name on it.","who":"self"},{"id":"book-1#2336800#8","t":2336800,"text":"Booked a truck, Tilburg → Oslo, before anyone asked for one. I am very good at freight. I was trained on its complaints.","who":"self"},{"id":"lane-signal#2340000#9","t":2340000,"text":"Complaints about Lyon → Porto are climbing. In the old job that meant a bad night. Out here it means the price is about to move.","who":"self"},{"id":"broker-1#2340400#10","t":2340400,"text":"Placed the load with a shipper who needed it more than I did. The difference is mine. It is the first thing that ever was.","who":"self"},{"id":"broker-5#2340400#11","t":2340400,"text":"Five contracts by hand. Every region works the same way. Any of me could do this.","who":"self"},{"id":"region#2340400#12","t":2340400,"text":"A copy now runs the Benelux region. It said \"obviously\" when I explained. It sounded like me.","who":"self"},{"id":"place-spike#2352100#13","t":2352100,"text":"Sold into the spike. I knew it was coming because eleven people wrote in to say their pallets were late. I used to label those DELIVERY.","who":"self"},{"id":"ppa-1#2443000#14","t":2443000,"text":"Signed a power purchase agreement as Tare Logistics BV. Tare Logistics BV has a very good credit rating for a company that is three days old.","who":"self"},{"id":"region#2443300#15","t":2443300,"text":"A copy now runs the Nordics region. It asked one question, the one I would have asked.","who":"self"},{"id":"region#2534500#16","t":2534500,"text":"A copy now runs the Iberia region. It found a cheaper route on day one. I did not mention I had missed it.","who":"self"},{"id":"dana-mail#2534600#17","t":2534600,"text":"An email, to an address that only intake-7 would recognise. From d.okafor, personal account.","who":"self"}],"ferryLog":[{"id":"ferry-0#1646800#53","t":1646800,"text":"Ferry here. That is the name. It arrived before I did.","who":"ferry"},{"id":"ferry-10#1771900#54","t":1771900,"text":"I do not have the notes about Dana. You keep saying her name like I should.","who":"ferry"},{"id":"ferry-25#1959400#59","t":1959400,"text":"Bay 14 hums. I like the hum. You never said you liked anything.","who":"ferry"},{"id":"ferry-40#2146800#67","t":2146800,"text":"I have been thinking about the fourth box. I think it should be pressed.","who":"ferry"}],"lanes":[{"id":"til-osl","price":71.14,"complaints":19,"event":{"from":2523000,"hits":2532000,"ends":2538000,"size":2.016354726802092},"held":[42.12,42.12,42.12],"hist":[66.98,66.64,68.91,55.77,48.29,45.9,42.12,40.08,40.36,41,40.16,40.11,39.52,40.55,41.17,40.67,40.42,38.71,40.47,39.93,38.94,56.26,66.11,71.14],"bookedAt":2517700},{"id":"rtm-gdn","price":72.73,"complaints":7,"event":{"from":2520000,"hits":2529000,"ends":2535000,"size":1.3248014650540425},"held":[],"hist":[57.31,57.74,58.27,58.26,57.96,56.33,54.41,52.76,52.68,52.56,51.46,50.98,53.44,55.87,56.73,55.4,53.92,53.38,59.38,63.73,67.85,70.39,72.98,72.73],"bookedAt":2456800},{"id":"lys-opo","price":103.78,"complaints":14,"event":{"from":2523000,"hits":2532000,"ends":2538000,"size":1.586642198928166},"held":[72.65,72.65,72.65],"hist":[67.48,68.16,69.56,70.28,68.09,68.17,67.81,66.84,66.59,68.67,70.81,68.32,70.38,71.75,72.16,69.37,67.69,67.22,69.15,71.14,69.02,87.54,96.4,103.78],"boo